#### Controller y DTOs
- **[ElectronicBillingController.cs](file:///c:/Users/Admin/Desktop/JAIRO/PROYECTOS/ERP-STORE-FAST/backend-api/Controllers/ElectronicBillingController.cs)** — 6 endpoints:
  - `POST /api/electronic-billing/emit/{saleId}` — Emitir factura electrónica
  - `GET /api/electronic-billing/xml/{saleId}` — Descargar XML
  - `GET /api/electronic-billing/ride/{saleId}` — Descargar PDF RIDE
  - `POST /api/electronic-billing/upload-signature` — Subir `.p12`
  - `GET /api/electronic-billing/status/{saleId}` — Consultar estado
  - `GET|PUT /api/electronic-billing/settings` — Gestionar configuración

